{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers approximately <strong>30 minutes</strong> of gameplay. Players will be introduced to the game\u2019s world and its main characters.  <br>Features such as advanced card collection, custom deck building, and later story chapters are <strong>not available</strong> in the demo version. <br>Please note: <strong>Demo save data will not carry over</strong> to the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/extras/C.gif?t=1749719898\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In West City, 2135, half a century after mysterious superpowers emerged, society has undergone dramatic changes. &quot;Superpowered criminals&quot; - undetectable, unpredictable, and untraceable - have become a massive threat to social stability and prosperity.  <br>In this chaotic era, the peace-loving superpowered girl &quot;Luna&quot; decides to follow her sister's path and join the government as a security officer to protect people.  <br>At this critical moment, the terrorist organization &quot;Liberators&quot; hidden in a corner of the city begins large-scale operations\u2014 The rookie female officer Luna will soon understand that the &quot;Liberators&quot; are far more than just heinous superpowered criminals. Facing conflicting beliefs, people's lamentations, and historical truths... how will this society of superpowers navigate such despair?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/extras/\u57ce\u5e02\u666f_\u6050\u653b\u7248_\u5b8c\u7a3f.png?t=1749719898\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Card Deck System in Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo features a <strong>pre-constructed official deck</strong> focused on the <strong>\u201cFloating Cannon\u201d</strong> archetype, allowing players to experience satisfying combo mechanics right from the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/extras/BOSS011.gif?t=1749719898\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/extras/\u9732\u5a1c_en.png?t=1749719898\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/extras/\u840a\u59c6_en.png?t=1749719898\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/extras/\u65e5\u8755_en.png?t=1749719898\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/extras/\u7cbe\u795e\u64cd\u4f5c_en.png?t=1749719898\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/extras/\u4e2d\u6a1e\u535a\u58eb_en.png?t=1749719898\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/extras/\u8840\u8089\u8056\u5973_en.png?t=1749719898\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709860?t=1749719898","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709860?t=1749719898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/335f9d06c9dfe5b44b9ceeb980105116b8dc491b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749719898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709860/335f9d06c9dfe5b44b9ceeb980105116b8dc491b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749719898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"!!Warning!!\r\nThis gam